## Manual test process (demo / Pages)

Page links carry no version (s3.1.37); asset tags are cache-busted by the bump script. Hard-refresh so scripts load.

### 1. Privacy Policy
- Open: `https://jadzadco.github.io/shoutout-demo/privacy.html`
- Expect: Do Not Sell section (`#do-not-sell`), processors list, production host wording `https://www.floqr.com`.

### 2. My Privacy (main path)
1. Sign in → `https://jadzadco.github.io/shoutout-demo/patron-portal.html?tab=privacy`
2. Confirm **Privacy Policy** and **Do Not Sell or Share** links open the policy page.
3. Toggle **Do Not Sell or Share (CCPA / CPRA)** → **Save Privacy Preferences** → refresh → checkbox still on; report row shows Yes.
4. **Download My Data JSON** → file includes server export shape (`exportedAt`, `uid`, `profile`, `bundles`), not a local-only profile dump. If callable is down, JSON may note local-fallback — that is a deploy gap, not a pass.
5. **Request Data Delete** — only on a disposable test patron. Confirm prompt + type `DELETE`. Expect anonymized profile and sign-out. **Never** run on Master Admin or a real personal account.

### 3. GPC (optional)
- Enable browser Global Privacy Control (Chrome privacy settings / GPC-capable browser).
- Reload My Privacy → GPC notice visible; Do Not Sell set automatically (or on next Save / load patch).

### 4. Ads soft-gate
- With Do Not Sell on, use Search so ads rotate.
- Expect: targeted/profile-tag scoring stops; house / all-audience creatives may still show.

### 5. FloqAi
- On Search, ask “do not sell”, “privacy policy”, or “download my data”.
- Expect: links to My Privacy and/or Privacy Policy.

### 6. Automated gate (agents)
- `cd functions && node --test privacy-compliance.test.js ad-campaigns-business.test.js i18n-coverage.test.js`
- After `functions/**` or rules publishes: confirm GitHub **Functions CI and Deploy** is green for that SHA.

## Explicit non-goals for “safe” passes
- Do not disable App Check / phone OTP reCAPTCHA.
- Do not put `?v=` on Display URLs.
- Do not invent “TBA” consent or fake Privacy Policy legal entity — use placeholders marked TODO for counsel.
- Do not break SOS2FA transactional sends (document as security necessity; separate from marketing).

## First implementation slice (when asked to build)
A → B(ad targeting DNS only) → C(export callable) → D(publicProfiles) → E → F.

